## PART 9: RISK REGISTRY

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

| # | Risk | Impact | Probability | Mitigation |
|---|------|--------|-------------|------------|
| 1 | NVIDIA cloud API credits run out for users | Users can't generate | Medium | Clear docs on credit limits, support local server mode |
| 2 | NVIDIA changes gRPC protocol | Addon breaks | Low | Pin to specific proto version, monitor NVIDIA releases |
| 3 | grpcio wheel incompatible with future Blender Python | Won't install | Medium | Test on each Blender release, rebuild wheels as needed |
| 4 | NVIDIA discontinues cloud endpoint | Cloud mode broken | Medium | They already discontinued one (July 2025), emphasize local mode |
| 5 | scipy-less resampling has lower quality | Artifacts in animation | Low | Linear interpolation is fine for speech; can add scipy optional |
| 6 | Blender 5.x breaks addon API | Addon stops working | Low | Follow Blender deprecation warnings, test on betas |
| 7 | Large extension size from wheels (~10MB) | Slow download | Low | Acceptable; similar to other Blender extensions |
| 8 | Protobuf version conflict with other addons | Import errors | Medium | Namespace vendored stubs, lazy import grpcio |
| 9 | NVIDIA API requires function_id that changes | Cloud mode breaks | Medium | Store function_id in preferences, document how to find it |
| 10 | User's mesh has >10K shape keys (animation perf) | Slow keyframe insert | Low | Only animate mapped keys, batch keyframe insertion |
| 11 | Open-source competition — NVIDIA open-sourced SDK, anyone can build competing addon | Market share loss | HIGH | Ship fast — first-mover advantage is the primary moat. Build community, tutorials, presets. Be "the" A2F Blender addon before others appear |
| 12 | GPL licensing trap — Blender Extensions requires GPL, shared codebase may make paid version GPL too | Can't enforce proprietary license | Medium | Keep free/paid as separate codebases, or accept selling convenience/updates/support rather than code secrecy. Many successful addon devs sell GPL code |
| 13 | WAV-only audio format complaints — users will submit MP3/OGG and be frustrated | Bad reviews, support burden | HIGH | Add conversion in Milestone 7, or ship clear error messages with links to free WAV converters. Address before it drowns store reviews |
| 14 | API key support burden — "my key doesn't work" tickets for NVIDIA's infrastructure | Support time, bad reviews | Medium | Build excellent error messages ("401 means X, check Y"). Add "Test Connection" button (already planned). Invest in troubleshooting FAQ |
| 15 | NVIDIA free cloud tier disappears or gets rate-limited | Cloud-only users lose access | Medium | Local C++ SDK mode (Milestone 6) is the hedge. Promote local mode as premium feature |

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

## PART 10: LICENSING & LEGAL

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

### 10.1 Our Addon License
- **Free tier**: GPL-3.0 on Blender Extensions platform (cloud API mode only, 10s limit)
- **Paid tier**: Proprietary on Superhive/Gumroad (adds local offline mode, unlimited audio, all models)
- **Key distinction**: paid tier contains the local C++ SDK integration, model management,
  and batch processing — code that is separate from the GPL free tier
- **Pragmatic reality**: Many successful Blender addon developers sell GPL code. You're selling
  the download, updates, support, and curation — not code secrecy. If someone re-distributes
  your GPL code, they don't get your updates, support, or your reputation.

### 10.2 Third-Party Licenses We Must Comply With

| Component | License | Our Obligation |
|-----------|---------|---------------|
| nvidia_ace protobuf stubs (from Maya-ACE) | MIT | Include MIT license text |
| grpcio | Apache-2.0 | Include Apache license text |
| protobuf | BSD-3-Clause | Include BSD license text |
| Audio2Face-3D model (used via API) | MIT | No obligation (API call, not distributed) |
| Blender Python API | GPL-2.0+ | Addon must be GPL-compatible if distributed with Blender |

### 10.3 License File
Include LICENSES/ directory:
- LICENSES/MIT-nvidia-ace.txt
- LICENSES/Apache-2.0-grpcio.txt
- LICENSES/BSD-3-protobuf.txt
- LICENSE.txt (our addon license)

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

